# What CI runs the suite, ruff and mypy with. Locked into dev.txt by `make lock`. Keep these in step
# with pyproject.toml's dependencies, dev extra and build backend (tests/test_locks.py fails if they
# drift). The backend is here because `make setup` installs the project with --no-build-isolation;
# editables is what hatchling asks for to build it editable (get_requires_for_build_editable).
